cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JunctionLab, please cite this software repository."
type: software
title: "JunctionLab: 3D Traffic Simulation and Signal-Control Benchmarking"
authors:
  - name: Valomaxed
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
repository-code: "https://github.com/Valomaxed/junctionlab"
url: "https://github.com/Valomaxed/junctionlab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Academic software prototype combining an interactive Three.js junction
  simulator with offline SUMO/TraCI experiments, trajectory replay,
  and paired controller comparisons. Included demand and geometry are
  synthetic; field calibration and independent validation are pending.
keywords:
  - traffic simulation
  - SUMO
  - signal control
  - transportation engineering
  - reproducible experiments
